onal (MDLZ) Said on Its Q3 Earnings Call","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQMzhEQ3RBOGJlaVRHSWJRdHRjcDBRRlR2ZHVuSWw5WlFaQVh2WkU5bHNvLTNZVE50MDZXMEN3ck9rbnJyaFhPTUNLQ1lvVHVPRlEyVm11cXByWklwMHItMG1rcUkxSlVxdXctQkd5UUJvcEFJUkdmTGFrZGxVUGFFTDduNEFNWVZuUFFUOW95a3R5MWRWRDhhN1JUZkR1SWpDa3BmNWljaTRiSWsyQy1xVWVKM1ZoR1N2ZHVLUGtrVW1JaHNm?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"億滋國際 (MDLZ) 在第三季財報電話會議上的講話"},{"title":"Why is Mondelez International stock surging today? By Investing.com","src":"Investing.com Australia","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPRlJGdWJleGNaTFYzellCRHIyVTBleU5yU1RiU0ZPdkwta3h1VlRreUI1T0hLNURCcVB2S3hrTHRVaDh4YWVMYmpBa3BDTHJyaURWZ1hwaTRBblZ3eHk0NTgxa2piUF9TaFBzMGxTWHY2RGJjdDFXNGZVRms2TzMxNktid0Q0T3BiZXMtODl0Rk1jajJWcEtLMGVzOE1XUWJHY21ERzB0UXZlY0U5WTRR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"為什麼億滋國際股價今天飆漲？由 Investing.com 提供"},{"title":"Mondelez International (NASDAQ:MDLZ) Stock Gets Price Target Boost from Wells Fargo & Company","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"富國銀行提高億滋國際（納斯達克股票代碼：MDLZ）股票目標價"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-04","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1103982/000162828026005345/mdlz-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Mondel z International's purpose is to empower people to snack right. We sell our products in over 150 countries around the world. We are one of the world's largest snack companies with global net revenues of $38.5 billion and net earnings of $2.5 billion in 2025. Our core business is making and selling chocolate, biscuits and baked snacks. We also have additional businesses in adjacent, locally relevant categories including gum & candy, cheese & grocery and powdered beverages. Our portfolio includes iconic global and local brands such as Oreo, Ritz, LU, Clif Bar and Tate's Bake Shop biscuits and baked snacks, as well as Cadbury Dairy Milk, Milka and Toblerone chocolate.","zh":"Mondel z International 的宗旨是讓人們能夠正確享用零食。我們的產品銷往全球 150 多個國家。我們是全球最大的零食公司之一，2025 年全球淨收入為 385 億美元，淨利為 25 億美元。我們的核心業務是製造和銷售巧克力、餅乾和烘焙零食。我們還在鄰近的當地相關類別中擁有其他業務，包括口香糖和糖果、起司和雜貨以及粉狀飲料。我們的產品組合包括標誌性的全球和本地品牌，如 Oreo、Ritz、LU、Clif Bar 和 Tate's Bake Shop 餅乾和烘焙零食，以及吉百利牛奶、Milka 和 Toblerone 巧克力。"},{"en":"We strive to create a positive impact on the world and communities in which we operate while driving business performance. Our goal is to lead the future of snacking around the world by offering the right snack, for the right moment, made the right way. We aim to deliver a broad range of delicious, high-quality snacks that nourish life's moments, made with sustainable ingredients and packaging.","zh":"我們努力在推動業務績效的同時，對我們營運所在的世界和社區產生積極影響。我們的目標是透過在正確的時刻以正確的方式提供正確的零食，引領世界各地零食的未來。我們的目標是提供各種美味、高品質的零食，以可持續的原料和包裝製成，滋養生活的每一刻。"},{"en":"We aim to be the global leader in snacking by focusing on growth, execution, culture and sustainability. We are optimizing our portfolio of leading brands and have refined our strategy to accelerate growth, prioritizing our fast-growing core categories of chocolate, biscuits and baked snacks. Our strategic plan builds on our strong foundations, including leadership in attractive categories, an attractive global footprint, a strong core of iconic global and local brands, marketing, sales, distribution and cost excellence capabilities and top talent with a growth mindset.","zh":"我們的目標是透過專注於成長、執行、文化和永續發展，成為零食領域的全球領導者。我們正在優化我們的領先品牌組合，並完善我們的加速成長策略，優先考慮快速成長的巧克力、餅乾和烘焙零食等核心類別。我們的策略計劃建立在我們堅實的基礎上，包括在有吸引力的類別中的領導地位、有吸引力的全球足跡、標誌性全球和本地品牌的強大核心、營銷、銷售、分銷和成本優化能力以及具有成長心態的頂尖人才。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We generally sell our products to supermarket chains, wholesalers, supercenters, club stores, mass merchandisers, distributors, convenience stores, gasoline stations, drug stores, value stores and other retail food outlets. We also sell products directly to businesses and consumers through various pure play e-retail platforms, retailer digital platforms, our direct-to-consumer websites and social media platforms. No single customer accounted for 10% or more of our net revenues from continuing operations in 2025. For a discussion of long-term demographics, consumer trends and demand, refer to Business Trends within Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.","zh":"我們一般將產品銷售給連鎖超市、批發商、超級中心、俱樂部商店、大型商場、經銷商、便利商店、加油站、藥局、超值商店及其他零售食品店。我們也透過各種純電子零售平台、零售商數位平台、我們的直接面向消費者的網站和社群媒體平台直接向企業和消費者銷售產品。到 2025 年，沒有任何一個客戶占我們持續營運淨收入的 10% 或以上。有關長期人口統計、消費者趨勢和需求的討論，請參閱管理層對財務狀況和營運結果的討論和分析中的業務趨勢。"},{"en":"Our product distribution network encompasses direct store delivery, company-owned and satellite warehouses, distribution centers, third party distributors and other facilities. Additionally, we leverage the services of independent sales offices and agents in various international locations. Through our global digital commerce organization and capabilities, we pursue online growth with partners in key markets around the world, including both pure e-tailers and omni-channel retailers. We continue to invest in advertising and consumer promotions, talent and digital capabilities. Our digital commerce channel strategies play a critical role in our ambition to be the global leader in snacking.","zh":"我們的產品經銷網路包括直接商店交付、公司自有倉庫和衛星倉庫、分銷中心、第三方經銷商和其他設施。此外，我們也利用各個國際地點的獨立銷售辦事處和代理商的服務。透過我們的全球數位商務組織和能力，我們與全球主要市場的合作夥伴（包括純電子零售商和全通路零售商）一起追求線上成長。我們繼續投資廣告和消費者促銷、人才和數位能力。我們的數位商務通路策略對於我們成為全球零食領導者的雄心壯志發揮著至關重要的作用。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in highly competitive markets that are comprised of global, regional and local competitors, including new start-up brands and businesses. Some competitors have different profit objectives and investment time horizons than we do and therefore may approach pricing and promotional decisions differently. We compete based on product quality, brand recognition and loyalty, service, product innovation, taste, convenience, nutritional value, the ability to identify and satisfy consumer preferences, effectiveness of our digital and other sales and marketing strategies, routes to market and distribution networks, promotional activities and price. Our advantaged global","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的市場中經營，這些市場由全球、區域和本地競爭對手組成，其中包括新成立的品牌和企業。一些競爭對手的利潤目標和投資期間與我們不同，因此可能會採取不同的定價和促銷決策。我們的競爭是基於產品品質、品牌認知度和忠誠度、服務、產品創新、口味、便利性、營養價值、識別和滿足消費者偏好的能力、我們的數位和其他銷售和行銷策略的有效性、市場路線和分銷網路、促銷活動和價格。我們的全球優勢"},{"en":"footprint, operating scale and portfolio of brands have all significantly contributed to building our market-leading positions across most of the product categories in which we sell. To grow and maintain our market positions, we focus on meeting consumer needs and preferences through a local-first commercial focus with a broad array of product formats, pack sizes and price points, new digital and other sales and marketing initiatives, product innovation and high standards of product quality. We also continue to optimize our manufacturing and supply chain networks and invest in our brands through ongoing research and development, advertising, marketing and consumer promotions.","zh":"足跡、經營規模和品牌組合都為我們在銷售的大多數產品類別中建立市場領先地位做出了重大貢獻。為了發展和維持我們的市場地位，我們透過以本地為先的商業重點，透過廣泛的產品格式、包裝尺寸和價格點、新的數字和其他銷售和行銷舉措、產品創新和高標準的產品質量，專注於滿足消費者的需求和偏好。我們也持續優化我們的製造和供應鏈網路，並透過持續的研發、廣告、行銷和消費者促銷來投資我們的品牌。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Europe","val":15027000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"North America","val":10679000000,"zh":"北美洲部門"},{"name":"Asia Middle East & Africa","val":7932000000,"zh":"亞洲、中東和非洲部門"},{"name":"Latin America","val":4899000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲部門"}],"total":38537000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Biscuits","val":18391000000,"zh":"餅乾"},{"name":"Chocolate","val":12696000000,"zh":"朱古力"},{"name":"Gum & Candy","val":4060000000,"zh":"Gum & Candy"},{"name":"Cheese & Grocery","val":2384000000,"zh":"Cheese & Grocery"},{"name":"Beverages","val":1006000000,"zh":"飲料"}],"total":38537000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":29194000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"US","val":9343000000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":38537000000}},"peers":["KHC","PM","GIS","CL","HSY"]}}